ND HIDDEN OBJECTIVES</strong> </h2>Make the game competitive by providing ever-new challenges, with a scoring system based on your ability to bring death and destruction upon your enemies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADABLE ARSENAL OF WEAPONS</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474850/extras/c02bbdcf43c952cb0a737937f93bad88.poster.avif?t=1713793648\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474850/extras/c02bbdcf43c952cb0a737937f93bad88.webm?t=1713793648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474850/extras/c02bbdcf43c952cb0a737937f93bad88.mp4?t=1713793648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A selection of 7 unlockable weapons as you progress through the game. Whether melee or ranged, varying your arsenal and discovering the secret abilities of weapons will be crucial to facing increasingly difficult enemy waves.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVOLVED VR QUALITY</strong></h2>Primarily designed for Meta Quest 2 standalone VR but also compatible with PCVR and Meta Quest 3.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CARD SYSTEM</strong> </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474850/extras/96d539ca3ab54a38a5b504e86f02d69b.poster.avif?t=1713793648\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474850/extras/96d539ca3ab54a38a5b504e86f02d69b.webm?t=1713793648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474850/extras/96d539ca3ab54a38a5b504e86f02d69b.mp4?t=1713793648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Create your own builds tailored to your playstyle with cards that unlock passive abilities, and conquer the powers of your enemies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEMONS WITH ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE</strong></h2>Various types of monsters capable of moving around the map to make each encounter unique. Monsters also power up as the game progresses to keep the challenge intriguing. Doesn't that sound demonic?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD TO DESTROY</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474850/extras/8a8494a187edab0124d054d052427578.poster.avif?t=1713793648\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474850/extras/8a8494a187edab0124d054d052427578.webm?t=1713793648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474850/extras/8a8494a187edab0124d054d052427578.mp4?t=1713793648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Traps, barriers, and tricks to help you stay alive. Channel enemies, make them crash into your spikes, or give them an electric shock to stun them. The battlefield is your canvas.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLOCKPUNK WORLD AND EUROPEAN FOLKLORE</strong></h2>Enter the castle of the Watchers and be guided by L.O.O.P., your robotic assistant. Discover a complex story built on direct references and reworkings of European folklore.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTINUOUSLY EVOLVING GAME</strong></h2>Wisdom Watcher is an organism in continuous evolution, and your feedback is its lifeblood! More arenas and modes are coming, so keep following us for all updates.<br><br><br><br>Wisdom Watcher continues to evolve with ongoing development, and to ensure the title perseveres to accommodate all users, community feedback is crucial and always appreciated. To reach out to the Space Whale development team directly, you can access the Discord server to become a game tester, or to express your opinion.",
